### numeric range with a repeated digit
ls photo_[10-15].jpg
>>> SC2102 1:10

### two letter ranges without repeats
ls report_[a-fx-z].txt
>>> none

### tr with a doubled letter
tr '[aa]' x < input.txt
tr [aa] x < input.txt
>>> SC2020 1:4
>>> SC2021 1:4
>>> SC2060 2:4

### negation followed by the same character in a double-bracket pattern
[[ $input == [!!]* ]] && echo "no bang"
>>> SC2154 1:4

### array subscript in a double-bracket -v operand
[[ -v counts[11] ]] && echo set
>>> none

### array subscript in a double-bracket -gt operand
[[ totals[11] -gt 3 ]] && echo big
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2309 1:4

### array subscript in a read argument
read -r slots[11]
echo "${slots[@]}"
>>> SC2154 2:7
>>> SC2313 1:9
